    "text": "By Amber Ruch ,\n7 hours ago MARSHALL COUNTY, Ky. (KFVS) - An investigation into a stolen side-by-side in western Kentucky led the arrest of another man for an unrelated incident. According to the Marshall County Sheriff’s Office, they responded to a complaint of a stolen side-by-side on Tuesday, May 19 on Briensburg Tatumsville Road. Deputies... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
